  },
  {
    "episode_id": 82329,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82329.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 59,
    "turn_text": "But that's such an interesting important point. I just wanted to drill down. So basically what you're saying is, I think it's so right, The people you knew who may never have gone to college at all, where every bit is smart and you saw that whether it was mechanical or operational or tactical or even strategic, every bit is smart and maybe smarter than those who have what society would say are the imprimaturs of intelligence like Harvard",
