        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Intelligence can manifest in various domains including mechanical, operational, tactical, and strategic thinking.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "I want to examine the point more closely.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
